1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,060
Ada danau yang katanya bisa
mengubah hewan jadi batu.

2
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:05,521
Danau Natron di Tanzania.

3
00:00:05,566 --> 00:00:07,297
Airnya sangat basa,

4
00:00:07,297 --> 00:00:08,767
bisa membakar kulit hewan.

5
00:00:08,767 --> 00:00:10,010
Di tepinya,

6
00:00:10,010 --> 00:00:13,584
burung dan kelelawar mati
tampak seperti patung.

7
00:00:13,584 --> 00:00:14,951
Benarkah jadi batu?

8
00:00:14,951 --> 00:00:15,764
Bukan.

9
00:00:15,764 --> 00:00:18,605
Garam soda di air danau
mengawetkan bangkai mereka,

10
00:00:18,605 --> 00:00:19,781
mirip mumi Mesir.

11
00:00:19,781 --> 00:00:21,222
Anehnya,

12
00:00:21,222 --> 00:00:26,132
danau maut ini justru tempat
lahir 3/4 flamingo kecil dunia.

13
00:00:26,508 --> 00:00:27,897
Kamu berani ke sini?

14
00:00:27,897 --> 00:00:29,900
Tulis di komentar.
